  "summaries": {
    "en": "Pokémon Sleep guide—sleep type optimization, ingredient team building, and efficient research point farming.",
    "ja": "ポケモンスリープ攻略。睡眠タイプ最適化、食材チームビルディング、研究ポイント効率農場を解説。"
  },
  "category": "simulation",
  "difficulty": "beginner",
  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541484977893-3b0cf93ac454?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "Sleep research score is determined by sleep duration, sleep consistency, and sleep type (Dozing, Snoozing, Slumbering)—high consistency over multiple nights boosts score multipliers more than a single perfect night.",
      "The Pokémon team that contributes to your camp while you sleep is based on their Energy and Specialty (ingredients, berries, or skills)—design your active team based on which resources your current camp research needs.",
      "Snorlax strength determines which Pokémon appear in research sessions; feeding Snorlax high-quality meals (cooked from ingredients gathered by your team) is the primary way to increase his strength rating.",
      "Each Pokémon has a main skill unique to its species—Skill trigger probability increases with friendship level; prioritizing Pokémon with high-value skills (Charge Strength S, Dream Shard Magnet, etc.) accelerates research.",
      "Dream Shards (from Snorlax meal bonuses and skilled Pokémon) fund the Slumber research upgrades that permanently boost entire research sessions; prioritize Dream Shard investment in early camp upgrades."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "睡眠研究スコアは睡眠時間・睡眠の一貫性・睡眠タイプ（うとうと・すやすや・ぐっすり）で決まる。複数夜の高い一貫性は単一の完璧な夜より多くスコア乗数を上昇させる。",
      "眠っている間にキャンプに貢献するポケモンチームはエナジーとスペシャリティ（食材・木の実・スキル）に基づく。現在のキャンプ研究が必要なリソースに基づいてアクティブチームを設計する。",
      "カビゴンの強さが研究セッションに出現するポケモンを決定する。チームが集めた食材から料理した質の高い料理でカビゴンを食べさせることが強さレーティングを上げる主な方法。",
      "各ポケモンには種族固有のメインスキルがある。スキル発動確率は仲良し度で上昇。高価値スキル（チャージ強さS・夢かけらマグネット等）を持つポケモムを優先することで研究が加速する。",
      "夢かけら（カビゴンの食事ボーナスやスキル持ちポケモムから）は研究セッション全体を永続的に向上させるおやすみ研究アップグレードの資金となる。夢かけら投資を序盤のキャンプアップグレードに優先する。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Setting Up Sleep Tracking",
        "body": "Pokémon Sleep uses your phone's accelerometer to detect sleep movement patterns. Place the phone screen-down on your mattress (not on a pillow) for most accurate readings. Enable Do Not Disturb mode before sleeping to prevent notifications from triggering false movement readings. The app recommends sleeping between 21:00–06:00 for maximum session reward windows; sessions outside this window still count but with reduced Pokémon encounter variety."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Team Composition for Ingredient Specialists",
        "body": "Mid-game camp progression benefits most from ingredient-specialist Pokémon teams. Ingredient-specialist Pokémon gather up to 4 different ingredient types per night; cooking recipes with diverse ingredients produce higher quality meals that give Snorlax larger EXP boosts. Key ingredient specialists include Delibird, Slowpoke, and Wigglytuff (berry + ingredient hybrid); build at least two ingredient specialists into your five-member active team."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Sleep Camp Mastery and Master Research",
        "body": "Master Research challenges require consistently high sleep scores (8+ hours, high consistency) combined with maxed Snorlax strength and large Pokémon diversity. Evolving Pokémon via Candy (from catching duplicates and Research Rewards) increases their skill frequency and base stats. Maintaining a diverse collection across all five sleep types enables research sleep studies that unlock special event Pokémon and unique recipes."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Placing the phone on a pillow instead of the mattress—pillow placement introduces false movement that inflates \"light sleep\" readings and reduces deep sleep detection accuracy.",
      "Not cooking meals daily—cooked meals provide substantially more Snorlax EXP than raw ingredients; even simple recipes with common ingredients produce meaningful Snorlax strength gains.",
      "Ignoring Pokémon energy management—each Pokémon has an energy gauge that depletes overnight; Pokémon that reach 0 energy contribute nothing to the session; ensure team energy is restored before sleeping.",
      "Wasting Biscuits on high-CP Pokémon—biscuits (premium resources) are best used on helper Pokémon with high skill values rather than strong battle Pokémon, as battle power is irrelevant in Sleep.",
      "Not maintaining sleep schedule consistency—irregular sleep hours produce lower consistency bonuses; a regular schedule of consistent 7–8 hour sleep windows maximizes weekly research point income significantly more than irregular high-duration nights."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "マットレスではなく枕にスマホを置く。枕の位置は偽の動きを導入して「浅い眠り」の読みを膨らませ、深い睡眠検出精度を下げる。",
      "毎日料理しない。料理した食事は生食材よりもカビゴンに実質的に多くのEXPを提供する。一般的な食材を使った簡単なレシピでもカビゴンの強さに意味のある向上をもたらす。",
      "ポケモンのエナジー管理を無視する。各ポケモムは一晩でエナジーゲージが消耗する。エナジーが0に達したポケモムはセッションに何も貢献しない。眠る前にチームエナジーが回復されていることを確認する。",
      "高CPポケモムにビスケットを無駄にする。ビスケット（プレミアムリソース）は強力なバトルポケモムよりも高いスキル値を持つヘルパーポケモムに最も効果的に使用される。睡眠ではバトル力は無関係。",
      "睡眠スケジュールの一貫性を維持しない。不規則な睡眠時間は低い一貫性ボーナスを生む。7〜8時間の一貫した睡眠ウィンドウの定期的なスケジュールは、不規則な高持続時間の夜よりも週間研究ポイント収入を大幅に最大化する。"
    ]
  },
